    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carnōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		2. caro, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abounding in flesh</i>, <i>fleshy.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of animals: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 4,
					1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palatum aquatilium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 37, 65, § 171</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 43, 98, § 243</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 45, 105, § 253</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">candor carnosus sanguineis venis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 37, 54, § 144</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 8,
				40, § 63</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of plants: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">resina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 20, 25, § 123</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 24, 38, § 90</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 31, 56, § 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">misy carnosius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					19, 3, 12, § 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carnosissimae olivae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					15, 3, 4, § 15</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">so also cortex,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					25, 5, 21, § 53</span></i>
			.</div>
